      "message": "Add Faderpunk Preset Editor\n\nLocal preset-bank editor (Node, no build step) that pulls from and\npushes to the device through the Configurator. Includes MIDI CC\ndatabase integration, EN/DE/FR localization, and a printable\ncheatsheet. Lives alongside the configurator as its own tool.",
