        "date": "2026-07-23T00:26:46Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(preset-editor): schema-driven param UI from firmware catalog\n\nAdd tools/gen-apps-catalog.py to generate apps-catalog.json from\nfirmware CONFIG blocks (same Param defs the configurator gets via\nGetAllApps). The preset editor now builds full param UIs for any app\nfrom this catalog instead of hand-coded per-app cases, fixing Echolot\nand other apps that were missing most of their parameters.\n\nAlso adds a dedicated Flags column for all checkbox-style params\n(bool, MidiNrpn, MidiIn) instead of scattering them across app extras,\nand fixes oversized checkbox padding inherited from the global input\nstyle.",
      "tree": {
